meta {
  name: 13_ForretningsforerPackageFilter
  seq: 13
}

docs {
  Scenario: The packages filter only selects clients that hold the package

    When the client list is filtered by the eiendom package
    Then the BRL and ESEK clients are returned carrying the eiendom package
    And the BBL client is not in the list

  The facilitator and its forretningsforer clients come from the register test
  data behind testdata/systemuser-clientdelegation. The eiendom package is
  scoped to the ESEK and BRL unit types, so the BBL client never holds it and
  must not be selected by the filter. The scenario is read only and needs no
  cleanup.
}
